        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.Prayermoji]</p>\n<p>You gain one of the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Prayer of Grace</strong> You gain a +20-foot status bonus to your Speeds until the start of your next turn.</p></li><li><p><strong>Prayer of Healing</strong> You regain healing Hit Points at the start of your next turn.</p></li><li><p><strong>Prayer of Protection</strong> You gain a +1 status bonus to AC and saving throws until the start of your next turn.</p></li><li><p><strong>Prayer of Retribution</strong> Until the start of your next turn, creatures that hit you with melee Strikes take spirit damage.</p></li></ul>"
